# The owner reviews a change to the monitor's exceptions, its workflow,
# its embedded trusted root, the AnchorSigner (its code, its build and
# each environment's compiled configuration, which the owner signs), its
# reconciler (the same) and
# this file (main is protected: a pull
# request, one approving review, and code-owner review are required).
/monitor/                        @mesmerverse
/.github/workflows/monitor.yml   @mesmerverse
/site/roots/                     @mesmerverse
/.github/CODEOWNERS              @mesmerverse
/deploy/                         @mesmerverse
/scripts/build-signer.sh         @mesmerverse
/cmd/anchor-signer/              @mesmerverse
/signer/                         @mesmerverse
/scripts/build-reconciler.sh     @mesmerverse
/cmd/anchor-reconciler/          @mesmerverse
/reconcile/                      @mesmerverse
/lambdaenv/                      @mesmerverse
# What the monitor's verdict rests on: the chain and bundle checks, the
# anchor verifier, the check command, and the modules they build with.
/site/chain.go                   @mesmerverse
/site/anchor.go                  @mesmerverse
/site/check.go                   @mesmerverse
/site/services.go                @mesmerverse
/site/roots.go                   @mesmerverse
/cmd/votesctl/check.go           @mesmerverse
/go.mod                          @mesmerverse
/go.sum                          @mesmerverse
